    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Pavil,<div>It looks like we hadn&#39;t implemented the exp() function for complex values. </div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve added an implementation for complex values and this should now be resolved in version 0.8.1993.</div><div><br></div><div>If you run into any R scripts that works in GNU R but not in Renjin, you can open a bug report at</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343755360000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eHirPLgK0qiGlDqt1XhHV\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues</a></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Alex</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
